<view class="page mine-page {{reduce?'reduce-motion':''}}"><view class="profile"><view class="profile-mark">自然</view><view><view class="title">我的自然手记</view><view class="sub">本地收藏 · 未连接账号或云同步</view></view></view>
<view class="settings-sections"><button class="secondary" data-section="privacy" bindtap="changeSection">隐私</button><button class="secondary" data-section="help" bindtap="changeSection">帮助与反馈</button><button class="secondary" data-section="about" bindtap="changeSection">关于</button></view>
<view wx:if="{{section==='privacy'}}" class="panel spaced"><view class="section">隐私</view><view class="sub spaced">地点默认隐藏；仅在你主动选择时使用地点接口，不自动采集或上传位置。公开卡片始终显示“地点未公开”，不包含精确坐标。</view><view class="setting-card"><text>本机显示已保存地点</text><switch checked="{{showLocation}}" bindchange="placeVisibility" aria-label="本机显示已保存地点"/></view><view class="sub">头像只保存在本机，不代表微信认证。反馈不会自动上传照片或笔记。</view></view>
<view wx:if="{{section==='help'}}" class="panel spaced"><view class="section">帮助与反馈</view><view class="help-copy">拍一张 → 鉴别并确认物种 → 生成彩绘卡 → 收入图鉴。识别或生成失败时不会保存失败卡，可重试。</view><view class="help-copy">相机或相册无法使用：检查微信系统权限。识别失败：检查网络，并核对下方鉴别照片同意设置。导出失败：确认照片仍可读取与本机空间充足。</view><view class="sub">点击下方通过微信主动提交反馈，也可复制模板。不会自动附带照片、位置、日志或私人笔记。</view><button class="primary spaced" open-type="feedback">通过微信提交反馈</button><button class="secondary spaced" bindtap="copyFeedback">复制反馈模板</button></view>
<view wx:if="{{section==='about'}}" class="panel spaced"><view class="section">关于去大自然里</view><view class="sub spaced">版本 {{version}}</view><view class="help-copy">用真实相遇建立自然收藏：自然、珍藏、可信。尊重生命与栖息环境，不捕捉、不打扰。</view><view class="help-copy">AI 彩绘是自然观察的艺术纪念，不是鉴别依据。物种资料有局限，不能用于食用、安全或医疗判断；识别不确定时请谨慎确认。</view><view class="sub">本地头像和收藏不代表已登录认证；会员支付与好友互通尚未开放。</view></view>
<view class="availability-links"><button class="secondary" data-section="membership" bindtap="changeSection">会员说明</button><button class="secondary" data-section="friends" bindtap="changeSection">好友说明</button></view>
<view wx:if="{{section==='membership'}}" class="panel spaced"><view class="section">会员 · 暂未开放</view><view class="help-copy">计划价格：月度 ¥{{membership.monthly}} / 月；年度 ¥{{membership.yearly}} / 年。</view><view class="help-copy">年度比逐月购买 12 个月省 ¥{{membership.saving}}，约 {{membership.savingPercent}}%。</view><view class="sub spaced">目前仅展示价格方案，尚未接入微信登录、CloudBase 会员后台及商户支付。不接受付款，也不会产生已开通状态；具体权益待开放时说明。</view><button class="secondary spaced" disabled="{{true}}">暂未开放购买</button></view>
<view wx:if="{{section==='friends'}}" class="panel spaced"><view class="section">好友 · 暂未开放</view><view class="help-copy">尚未连接微信登录与 CloudBase 好友服务，没有已建立的好友关系。</view><view class="help-copy">未来只展示对方明确公开物种。卡片、照片、地点与笔记默认私有，不自动公开，也不公开精确坐标。</view><view class="help-copy">复制需持有人批准；未获批准不会复制卡片或生成收藏记录。</view><button class="secondary spaced" disabled="{{true}}">好友连接尚未开放</button></view>
<view class="stats-panel spaced"><view class="stats"><view><text class="number">{{species}}</text><text>记录物种</text></view><view><text class="number">{{count}}</text><text>收藏卡片</text></view><view><text class="number">{{days}}</text><text>观察日期</text></view></view><view class="progress-rule"></view><view class="sub">仅统计真实收藏，不含示例资料卡。章节经验在「我的」查看。</view></view>
<view class="section spaced">我的笔记 · {{notes.length}}</view><view wx:if="{{!notes.length}}" class="empty-note">在卡片完整资料里，写下当时的天气、动作或一点发现。</view><view wx:for="{{notes}}" wx:key="id" class="note-card" data-id="{{item.id}}" bindtap="open"><view class="section">{{item.zh}}</view><view class="sub">{{item.text}}</view></view>
<view class="section spaced">最近观察</view><view wx:if="{{!recent.length}}" class="empty-note">拍下下一次遇见，留下自己的第一张卡。</view><view wx:for="{{recent}}" wx:key="id" class="record" data-id="{{item.id}}" bindtap="open"><image src="{{item.photoPath}}" mode="aspectFill"/><view><view>{{item.zh}}</view><view class="sub">{{item.date}} · {{item.finish}}</view></view></view>
<view class="section spaced">设置</view><view class="setting-card"><view><view class="section">减少动态效果</view><view class="sub">关闭倾斜与装饰光效，翻面直接切换</view></view><switch checked="{{reduce}}" color="#647B42" bindchange="motion"/></view>
<view class="setting-card"><view><view class="section">允许百度鉴别照片</view><view class="sub">仅在点击识别时上传所选照片至私有云并发送百度；关闭后须重新同意。</view></view><switch checked="{{recognitionConsent}}" color="#0e8a72" bindchange="recognitionConsentChange"/></view>
<view class="panel spaced"><view class="section">本地备份与清除</view><view class="sub spaced">备份包含笔记和本地图片路径；图片请单独导出，文件不会自动上传。</view><button class="secondary spaced" disabled="{{clearing || exportBusy}}" bindtap="exportData">导出本地记录 JSON</button><view wx:if="{{exportPath}}" class="row spaced"><button class="secondary grow" bindtap="saveBackup">发送备份文件</button><button class="secondary grow" bindtap="copyBackup">复制 JSON</button></view><button wx:if="{{cleanup}}" class="secondary spaced" bindtap="retry">重试清理 {{cleanup}} 个本地文件</button><button class="secondary spaced danger" disabled="{{clearing}}" bindtap="clear">{{clearing?'正在清理…':'清除全部本地数据'}}</button></view></view><navigation active="settings"/>
